    "turn_text": "speaking. Let's listen to it. And I think one of the things that we know, too, is that there are also actions at President Biden's disposal that he can mobilize. I'll start with the babies and the babies of the baby steps. Open abortion clinics on federal land and much more. So you just heard her talking and, you know, someone on the left are calling for this. They're saying Biden should utilize federal lands for abortion clinics. Is that something he can do? Is that something we should be concerned about? You know, what have you heard about that? Well, Lisa, with this administration, if they can't get something through Congress, they go through corporations to try to do DEI and ESG policies. They go through executive orders. They push everything they possibly can to achieve a goal through some other means than the will of the people. They are not into a government of Biden for the people. They are into a government of by and for the powerful. And the powerful is them. So when you hear such coming from the squad and from those on the left What you have to realize is there is Hyde Amendment language, there is Mexico City policy, things that we have agreed on a bipartisan basis to abide by that the Democrats repeatedly set aside or try to set aside. Now to begin to set up an abortion clinic on federal land There again, what they're trying to do is circumvent the will of the court or the decision of the court and the will of the people who repeatedly have said, no, we don't want taxpayer dollars being",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
